<p>Your melee attacks cripple your targets when they critically strike, lowering their movement speed by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 20%, 24%, 27%, 30%</acronym> and their accuracy by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7, 13, 16, 20, 24</acronym> for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> turns.</p><p>Additionally, you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 5%, 7%, 10%, 12%</acronym> chance to critically strike with your melee attacks.</p>